Life cycle of tangible/physical CIs#Related#{1}":[58,58],"#Life cycle of tangible/physical CIs#Related#{2}":[59,60]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Definitions of life-cycle values for tangible/physical CIs","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-lifecycle-df-tangible-physical.md","line":28},{"title":"'Map existing status values to CSDM life-cycle value pairs' section in the 'Foundation domain' topic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/foundation-domain.md","line":34},{"title":"identification rules","target":"c_IdentificationRules","line":38},{"title":"Definitions of life-cycle values for tangible/physical CIs","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-lifecycle-df-tangible-physical.md","line":40},{"title":"Retiring a service instance can affect tangible/physical CIs","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-retire-srvc-inst-affects-hdw.md","line":42},{"title":"Tangible/physical tables in the CMDB","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-lifecy-tables-tang-physical.md","line":44},{"title":"CSDM reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-content-frame-reference.md","line":47},{"title":"Definitions of life-cycle values for tangible/physical CIs","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-lifecycle-df-tangible-physical.md","line":52},{"title":"Retiring a service instance can affect tangible/physical CIs","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-retire-srvc-inst-affects-hdw.md","line":54},{"title":"Identification rules","target":"c_IdentificationRules","line":58}],"metadata":{"title":"Life cycle of tangible/physical CIs","description":"The tangible/physical life-cycle states represent the overall life cycle of physical assets and CIs as related to their products. Tangible/physical assets are physical items that are stocked, for example computers, monitors, and keyboards. The stages and statuses for the tangible/physical life-cycle process are visible only in hardware-related tables in Asset Management and the CMDB.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-lifecycle-hardware.html","release":"australia","product":"Common Service Data Model \\(CSDM\\)","classification":"common-service-data-model-csdm","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Reference","CSDM","Configuration Management","Extend ServiceNow AI Platform capabilities"],"tags":["#servicenow-platform","#csdm","#business-services","#technical-services","#cmdb","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/servicenow-platform/common-service-data-model-csdm/csdm-lifecycle-hardware.md"},
